{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56d4c8249791722caba264c0571e4e1ea6006db99be34b5f411461abec2212cb",
      "text": "与杂志编辑的商讨会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:839e4c7dd16e802b71cc97aaa778e806b6b6a7bd3f54c3e2720535b21db6a58c",
      "text": "FRAME的各位，这次非常感谢各位\n能够接受我们的邀约！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78c46b0d7aba5d21af2a7ee0e6a5556d0de1d6d33ad260cdc18d0784b7c17970",
      "text": "哪里，我们才该感谢您的看重。……顺便想问一下，\n能冒昧请教一下邀约我们的理由吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:987010b2985a990c06c0b8ed6e1befad2b76bfb0566de4c69845b9834e6e5191",
      "text": "好的。各位拥有曾是公务员这一独特的背景\n对吧。加上这份背景给予人的印象与各位的人品，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c72e8d614c05831685aa08ab2eb94e0df87608d22c3d5042250727bef701e6",
      "text": "在我们杂志的读者问卷中，也屡次作为\n给人十足安全感的理想男友被提及姓名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cc98060af9f880016d595a8a012d691ab51cc1c747a92dad0cb212ad961a573",
      "text": "因此，我们希望做一期聚焦于各位身上的这份“可靠感”的\n专题企划，才冒昧提出了这次的合作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2c12962d490414f2f16d25c8dc22a5e06aecee8f6846c13ba44b5d12c3ad073",
      "text": "原来如此。既然是这样的话，\n我们就更得加把劲才行了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6db79685536e38d6fd943f93b4eecba085b33de54637f85501e8a87bcacbd90",
      "text": "首先是在海边和街头取景，\n最后再去教堂拍摄对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44e0a10a4adf684028dc95f41e161cbbf0b487ca6c7a03360ac7d9d16de702df",
      "text": "是的！这也蕴含着记录两人携手走过的\n时光这一层深意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a9a3c4a661b9233aed24c6f5287bb6b4b14afa931c425280fec215d84b44512",
      "text": "也就是记录通往婚姻的每一个珍贵瞬间啊……\n感觉好浪漫呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f65ca90c871b38db2d0461892410409ce9ae397a6724502b0c16bce4af0c2b5",
      "text": "为了能拍出优秀的照片，我们也会全力以赴的。\n接下来就请多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
